    "homeType": "CONDO",
    "description": "Beautifully updated 2BD/1BA condo in a classic two-unit Inner Richmond building including garage and street parking spaces. Light-filled and thoughtfully designed, this home features a bay-windowed living room, hardwood floors throughout, generous closet space, and a split-bedroom layout for privacy and flexibility. The bright kitchen includes white cabinetry, granite counters, subway tile backsplash, and a built-in desk, ideal for remote work or morning coffee. The tastefully updated bathroom is serene and modern, while the spacious primary bedroom offers dual closets and bay windows. Additional highlights include 1-car, side-by-side parking with its own independent electric garage door access, deeded storage, common laundry in the garage, and a secluded shared patio. Just blocks from Golden Gate Park and Clement Street favorites like Arsicault Bakery, Pasta Supply Co, and Green Apple Books, this condo offers timeless charm and modern comfort in one of San Francisco's most beloved neighborhoods."
  },
